<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney on News Corp.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Smith Barney on News Corp.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst John Reidy said he downgraded News Corp Ltd to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited likelihood that company's entrance in domestic satellite TV business &quot;is going to drag on.&quot;</p>
<p>-- sees &quot;tough comparisons in its television and cable business,&quot; due in part to start-up costs of Fox News.</p>
<p>-- added that it will be tough to follow box office performances of &quot;Independence Day&quot; and &quot;Star Wars&quot; movies.</p>
<p>-- ADRs fell 1/8 to 18-1/2.</p>
</text>
